@startuml 15_state_staging
' StagingIntent.state in anemoi-daemon. Completed and Failed are terminal.
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

state "Blocked" as Blocked
state "Pending" as Pending
state "Completed" as Completed
state "Failed" as Failed

[*] --> Blocked : StagingIntent::new
Blocked --> Pending : queue_intent\n[runnable: mock runtime or gate open]
Pending --> Completed : load_model accepted\nor model reported ready
Pending --> Failed : load_model error
Pending --> Pending : tick skipped\n[live runtime and gate closed] / note_tick
Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]

note right of Blocked
  A non-runnable intent stays Blocked with
  last_error set. Normal flow has no later
  transition out; a new decision queues a new intent.
end note
@enduml
